<div xmlns:perseus="http://www.perseus.org/meta/perseus.rdfs#" xmlns:dctype="http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/" xmlns:tufts="http://www.tufts.edu/" xmlns:alph="http://alpheios.net/namespaces/tei" class="alpheios-lex-text_container en">
    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n44480" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">εὔμετρ-ος</span></b> , <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ον</span>,
			<div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>well-measured,
				well-calculated</i>, 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">σφενδόνα</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					A.
					<u>Ag.</u>
					1010
				</span></i>
			 (lyr.); <i>well-proportioned</i>, 
				v.l. for
				<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἔμμητρον</span>
			, <i><span class="en">
				Theoc.
				25.209
			</span></i>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>2.</b>
			<i>of moderate size</i> or <i>proportions</i>, 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">οἶκος</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Aret.
					<u>CA</u>
					1.1
				</span></i>
			. Adv. -<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ως</span> ib.<i><span class="en">
				1.6
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				Sor.
				1.86
			</span></i>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>3.</b>
			<i>excellent in metre</i>, [
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">λέξις] εὔ. καὶ εὔρυθμος</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					D.H.
					<u>Comp.</u>
					25
				</span></i>
			; opp. <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">κακόμετρος</span>, <i><span class="en">
				Phld.
				<u>Po.</u>
				1676.8
			</span></i>.</div>
    </div> <div class="alpheios-lex-footnotes en"> </div>
